retentious, wrong tone. Use these to argue.\n\nWe also need to reference prior discussion: we agree with Anna's reaffirmation, and Sofia's points about C.\n\nThus produce message: \"I agree with Anna that B remains front-runner, but we should also consider D's profile. While D shows strong problem solving and responsibility, his hot temper and know-it-all attitude could be more detrimental to crew cooperation than B's grumpiness. Therefore I maintain my vote for B, with recommendation for onboarding.\"\n\nMake sure metadata vote is Candidate B.\n\nProceed."}
